{"id":"n83605-1-5","stage":1,"title":"푹 · 睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83605-1-5-1","ko":"지수야, 너 얼굴이 좋아 보인다?","zh":"智秀，你气色看起来真好啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼굴이","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，良好","explanation":"좋다：好，良好；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"4","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보인다?","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸色","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"某种心理状态表露于外的表情。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，良好","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"身体条件或健康状态等高于一般人。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b2ec02ff93d3d235f33.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83605-1-5-2","ko":"며칠 푹 쉬었더니 힘도 나고 기분도 좋네.","zh":"好好休息了几天，既有力气了，心情也变好了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"며칠","meaning":"几天","explanation":"며칠：几天","readings":[{"term":"며칠","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36676","senseId":"2","lemma":"며칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"푹","meaning":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","explanation":"푹：睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","readings":[{"term":"푹","audio":"/audio/0080f27d41b51df36d72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83605","senseId":"1","lemma":"푹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쉬었더니","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"힘도","meaning":"力量，力气","explanation":"힘：力量，力气；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나고","meaning":"生，产生","explanation":"나다：生，产生；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기분도","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋네.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"879abb6ed1ed4d59","term":"며칠","zh":"几天","audio":"/audio/879abb6ed1ed4d59a03e.mp3","entryId":"36676","definition":"几个日子。","pronunciation":["며칠"]},{"id":"0080f27d41b51df3","term":"푹","zh":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","audio":"/audio/0080f27d41b51df36d72.mp3","entryId":"83605","definition":"睡得很沉或使疲劳的身体得以充分休息的样子。","pronunciation":["푹"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"68de24edc341fabd","term":"힘","zh":"力量，力气","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3","entryId":"28633","definition":"人或动物自己运动或使其他事物移动的肌肉作用。","pronunciation":["힘"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"生，产生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种情感或感觉。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc0403845a50df2b0070.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83605","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.7001,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好好休息了几天，既有力气了，心情也变好了呢。","事情这么多，午饭要怎么办呢？","智秀，你气色看起来真好啊？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["好好休息了几天，既有力气了，心情也变好了呢。","智秀，你气色看起来真好啊？","事情这么多，午饭要怎么办呢？"],"answer":0}]}
